         <dc:rights>Syndication Allowed</dc:rights>
      </item>
      <item>
         <title><![CDATA[WhatsApp is a 'lifeline' for refugees. Advocates fear it could be severed in fight over federal bill]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/lawful-access-bill-whatsapp-newcomers-9.7429493?cmp=rss</link>
